Z||000022||Patrick||12-15-1999||03:25 PM||||<BR>Oh man, I feel the performance anxiety welling up again. I had to mention this once before to Kel. Hey, easy guys! Keep it clean! It's not what you think!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Well here, see for yourself:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/000240.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/000240.html</A> <P>Thanks Ross. There's two tricks to finding old threads. First, you gotta read all the posts every day. Second, when using the <B>Search</B> function, use as many words as you can remember from the post(s) you're trying to find. Piece of cake!<P>And Bill, where did you learn to ask a lady, "Do you have a life?" I know you meant no harm, but geez...... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
